The MIT license above covers the RawTouch additions in this repository.
The repository starts from MoErgo's west-based Go60 configuration
template (https://github.com/moergo-keyboards/go60-zmk-config-west) and
keeps its commit history. Files inherited from that template remain
MoErgo's, under the template's own terms; the MIT license above does not
apply to them. The stock keymap, config/go60.keymap, carries its own MIT
notice from The ZMK Contributors.
